{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Geometry Shooter PRO takes the exciting foundation of the original Geometry Shooter and cranks it up to the next level! Jump into this hand-drawn arcade game where precision meets action and smart planning.\u00a0What seems straightforward at first, reveals multiple layers and a variety of challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195710/extras/4795ee325196dcc97e379da19f3bcfff.avif?t=1759110719\" width=800 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195710/extras/313ae3bc4471d0c21b499801043b3932.poster.avif?t=1759110719\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195710/extras/313ae3bc4471d0c21b499801043b3932.webm?t=1759110719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195710/extras/313ae3bc4471d0c21b499801043b3932.mp4?t=1759110719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire from a moving cannon at expanding geometric shapes like circles, squares, and triangles. Aim to hit as many as you can with a single shot, as a new shape will emerge where the fired bullet lands. Each figure displays a number indicating how many hits it takes to destroy it, so strategize your shots wisely. It's not all about a good aim, but also smart planning and anticipating what's coming next!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195710/extras/c77eaa7cbaf36f6c8430b345e5ff3869.avif?t=1759110719\" width=800 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195710/extras/bc66da58f1c05fff8f293e4884073bca.poster.avif?t=1759110719\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195710/extras/bc66da58f1c05fff8f293e4884073bca.webm?t=1759110719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195710/extras/bc66da58f1c05fff8f293e4884073bca.mp4?t=1759110719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the use of cool power-ups you can utilize even more diverse strategies! Collect bombs that crush through your targets, or hit extra life points to keep the fun going. Be careful though - newly formed shapes can effectively block your options, and if a fired bullet goes back behind the line of your cannon, you'll lose one life!\u00a0Decide whether it's worth risking a tricky shot to collect a helpful power-up before it disappears, or choose a safer option.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195710/extras/bdc8a72bbcad74c24e205b56c3ed472e.avif?t=1759110719\" width=800 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195710/extras/3d272472eefab7b7c690c74f939838a6.poster.avif?t=1759110719\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195710/extras/3d272472eefab7b7c690c74f939838a6.webm?t=1759110719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195710/extras/3d272472eefab7b7c690c74f939838a6.mp4?t=1759110719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Geometry Shooter PRO, you can top your scores in single-player mode, challenge friends head-to-head in versus mode, or collaborate with them in co-op mode! Find a way to surprise and block your opponents or a clever strategy to support your teammates. Shoot a variety of targets together and try to survive as long as you can! All of this presented with attractive graphics and entertaining sound effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195710/extras/e9c7afdc065b3c70edf0431538c082c0.avif?t=1759110719\" width=800 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Enjoy easy to understand, yet skill based gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Have fun with other players in versus and co-op modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Collect useful power-ups to help you in your struggles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Top your scores in the leaderboards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Admire hand-drawn graphics and cool sound effects\u00a0</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Fatality!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3195710/97f973c4e9141af456214b12381b39dfe9a5ecc9.jpg"},{"name":"Combo Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3195710/23aeb6b983fdc62090366a420263668e0e3a1f50.jpg"},{"name":"Combo God","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3195710/399c16dacc16a9a83b07524ce04041f79f679949.jpg"},{"name":"It's a Start","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3195710/9f67a5f5f24cfdc7b1d87b7c98bead2822a0b19c.jpg"},{"name":"Hooked","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3195710/263100e2b8